{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b0b5999c2a9f88e6","name":"Mon Mothma","source":{"id":"source:reference-b0b5999c2a9f88e6","title":"Mon Mothma","revision":19525,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:07:44Z","sha256":"2c4b8b76b809cc6173b48bce548fa778055f58564496af75e738979492a4071a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19525","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Mon%20Mothma&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b0b5999c2a9f88e6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Unlike ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bail Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bail_Organa","referenceId":"reference:25959f9d5a1655a3"},", Mon Mothma speaks more openly against Imperial oppression and thus brings upon herself Palpatine's attention and, ultimately, reprisal.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Senator from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chandrila"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chandrila","referenceId":"reference:bab510dcf0a21111"}," maintains the diplomatic tradition of her homeworld, which espouses outspoken and frank political discussion and even dissent. She opposes the military buildup before ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," and advocates that Palpatine relinquish his power when the conflict ends. Mon Mothma not only represents Chandrila's interests in galactic affairs, but speaks out for the rights of individual local systems as Imperial policies begin depriving them of their rights to self-governance.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Her forthright views against the Empire bring Mon Mothma under closer scrutiny by the ISB, COMPNOR, and the Emperor himself, thus preventing her from dabbling in more effective covert efforts to undermine Imperial rule. She uses her official channels, Senatorial privilege, and political contacts to effect change, maintaining a belief that the system of government, no matter how broken, still has some small degree of effectiveness. During these years, she meets frequently with colleagues on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," and their homeworlds, introduces fruitless measures to grant local systems relief from Imperial policies, and tries to place Senate oversights on Imperial operations. Mon Mothma also tutors Bail Organa's daughter, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Leia Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Leia_Organa","referenceId":"reference:225034c3501e6ae6"},", in diplomatic and political affairs, preparing her to succeed her father as Alderaan's representative in the Senate and eventually lead a galaxy-spanning resistance movement.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Toward the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Times"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Times"},", Palpatine finally loses patience with Mon Mothma's outspoken opposition and covert operations with resistance groups. He orders her arrest by ISB agents, but she narrowly escapes capture thanks to a tip from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bail Organa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bail_Organa","referenceId":"reference:25959f9d5a1655a3"},". She continues working in secret to undermine Imperial power, support and unite disparate insurgent groups, and forge an official alliance that openly opposes the Empire.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Mon Mothma Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +16\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Bothese, Mon Calamarian, Sullustese\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 19 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 19), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 18, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 22\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 45, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.